[[Goblin]]s can be assigned as a [[slayer task]], with no [[Slayer]] level requirement by [[Turael]] (or [[Spria]] after [[A Porcine of Interest]]). [[Sergeant Strongstack]], [[Sergeant Grimspike]], and [[Sergeant Steelwill]] count, and are susceptible to the bonus from [[Slayer Helmet]]/[[Black Mask]].

